        "id": 1098053
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-12-13T23:42:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ImsFeature doesn\u0027t remove the feature with onFeatureRemoved, it notifies the feature of its removal from the framework (also notice the line below this one). I think \"onFeatureRemoved\" conveys this a little better.",
      "parentUuid": "315f76c8_7554e014",
