      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-12-13T23:42:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not thread safe, but not sure why it would need to be. This is a data container class that is created, capabilities are added to be enabled/disbled, and then sent over AIDL (where it is copied).",
      "parentUuid": "bf701c9f_af0a15d4",
