      "writtenOn": "2017-12-13T20:43:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It *may* be totally fine in this class, but it looks like it\u0027s not safe to duplicates, which means that someone who calls getCapabilities() needs to handle duplicates, which seems like an implementation detail.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 115,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 119,
        "endChar": 13
