        "patchSetId": 11
      },
      "lineNbr": 172,
      "author": {
        "id": 1060151
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-12-13T20:43:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m pretty strongly opposed to exposing this as part of the IMS interface. It\u0027s vendor-specific implementation detail for device provisioning, so it belongs in a vendor library.\n\nCan we plan to leave all of this private while we work on removing it?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 126,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 172,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "8794dc069e6a1a5a8b5f2f364012c414bd11b556",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2035b0f9_8c3fffc9",
        "filename": "telephony/java/android/telephony/ims/internal/stub/ImsConfigImplBase.java",
        "patchSetId": 11
      },
      "lineNbr": 172,
      "author": {
        "id": 1061207
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-12-13T22:14:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we are hiding these, lets make sure that the capabilities callbacks are triggered when user preferences changed.\n\nAlso +1 to hiding these. framework should not be telling IMS package the values to set for those values, this should be coming from config doc.",
      "parentUuid": "787b1dce_dd68dd02",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 126,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 172,
        "endChar": 5
      },
